Auth API > Security
Dashboard API > Background Jobs
AI API > AI Engine
Risk API > AI Engine
Risk API > Business Core
Compliance API > Business Core
Business API > Business Core
Business API > AI Engine
System API > Redis

// Core → Data
Security > MongoDB
Security > Redis
AI Engine > MongoDB
Business Core > MongoDB
Background Jobs > MongoDB
Background Jobs > Redis

// Deployment
Deployment > NGINX
Deployment > MongoDB
Deployment > Redis
